OL,3,GNEWSAArchitecture contest launched to
OL,4,Aredesign fire-damaged buildings
OL,5,
OL,6,FA competition has been launched to
OL,7,Fredesign prominent sites in Glasgow's
OL,8,FPollokshields area which were destroyed
OL,9,Fby two major fires.
OL,11,FThe local authority will ask architects
OL,12,Fto submit designs for new buildings
OL,13,Faimed at  complementing the town centre
OL,14,Fat Albert Cross.
OL,16,FTwo B-listed tenement buildings were
OL,17,Fdemolished after fires in November 2019
OL,18,Fand April 2020.
